DESCRIPTION:📚🚀🌍Join local teen author Sena Moses Adzei for the hy
 brid launch of his new book SENA'S EPIC TRAVEL DIARY! Sena has been fortun
 ate to travel all around the world with his family - to 20 different count
 ries and across 5 continents - so get ready! This Saturday\, Sena will te
 ll you all about his exciting journeys as recounted in his new book\, whic
 h doubles as a graphic novel and activity book.\nThe presentation will beg
 in at 2pm at Blackhurst CC. If you prefer to join the presentation virtual
 ly\, copy + paste the link to access the livestream: HTTPS:US02WEB.ZOOM.US
 /J/88592826737.\nThe presentation will include remarks from Sena\, a live 
 reading\, a Q&A\, book signing and more!\nGet set - it's going to be a fas
 cinating whirlwind of a ride!\nAdmission: Free. All are welcome - #ReadDif
 ferently📚
